        },
        {
          "text": "I-altare lamapulangwe laliyizingalo ezintathu ukuphakama, nobude balo buyizingalo ezimbili; amakhona alo nobude balo nezindonga zalo kwakungokwezinkuni; wathi kimi: “Leli yitafula eliphambi kukaJehova.",
